  "answer": "```julia\nusing Makie\n\nfunction makeplot(x, mu, sigma)\n    fig = Figure(size=(640, 400))\n    ax = Axis(fig[1, 1], xlabel=\"Time\", ylabel=\"Value\", title=\"Estimate\")\n\n    # Plot the mean line\n    line = ax.plot!(x, mu, color=:blue, label=\"Mean\")\n\n    # Plot the semi-transparent blue band\n    band = ax.plot!(x, mu .- sigma, color=:blue, alpha=0.3, linewidth=0)\n    ax.plot!(x, mu .+ sigma, color=:blue, alpha=0.3, linewidth=0)\n\n    # Add legend\n    ax.legend(position=:lt)\n\n    return fig, ax\nend\n```\n",
